        <obo:BFO_0000050 rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00010129"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Effort Sharing Decision (ESD) is the European effort sharing for the years 2013-2020. It covers the European Union, Norway, Iceland and Liechtenstein and the following greenhouse gases: carbon dioxide, methane, nitrous oxide, hydrofluorocarbons, perfluorocarbons and sulphur hexafluoride. Emission quantities under the ESD are calculated using global warming potentials from the Fourth IPCC Assessment Report.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118>ESD</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">Lastenteilungsentscheidung</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Effort Sharing Decision</rdfs:label>
